#: includes/class-retreat.php:415
msgid ""
"Hello, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the letter you wrote to [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] for the retreat \"[retreat_name]\".\n"
"\n"
"In the end, [attendant_name] did not attend the retreat. For confidentiality and data protection reasons, we are going to destroy the digital record of your letter and the printed copy that had been prepared to be delivered.\n"
"\n"
"Your letter is attached to this email, so that you can keep it and use it again if [attendant_name] takes part in a retreat in the coming months.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards."
msgstr ""
"Hola, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Us agraïm la carta que vau escriure a [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] per al recés «[retreat_name]».\n"
"\n"
"Finalment, [attendant_name] no ha participat en el recés. Per motius de confidencialitat i de protecció de dades, destruirem el registre digital de la vostra carta i la còpia impresa que s'havia preparat per a lliurar-la.\n"
"\n"
"Us adjuntem la vostra carta en aquest correu electrònic, perquè la pugueu conservar i tornar a utilitzar si [attendant_name] participa en un recés en els propers mesos.\n"
"\n"
"Salutacions cordials."

